			<div class="content" id="post-content-2312405">
									

<p>The object itself is more interesting than it should be (especially what the people staring at it say), and with the excellent interview and the notes at the end, I enjoy it a lot more than I thought I would.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>No supernatural strength or unusual speed has been observed in subjects during these outbursts.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I really like this line. I'm so glad you didn't go the &quot;THIS MAKES YOU SUPER STRONG AND FAST RAAA&quot; method, and that the people only act the way they do because they must &quot;stand as he does&quot;. *shudders*</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Mobile Task Force [REDACTED]</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This, then, is my only complaint. You can totally use a real Mobile Task Force here, it's alright. The redaction seems silly because there's no real reason to redact. Even <a href="/scp-2310">SCP-2310</a>, which details how an MTF went horribly wrong in recovering a skip, actually says what the MTF is.</p>
<p>Otherwise, +1.</p>

